# KT24 quotes

Cite [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Sec 10. **AGENTS.md wins.** Do not dump Core Book text into this rule.

## Allowed

Under `games/kill_team_2024/` only: verbatim quotes from **owned local** KT24 PDFs and WarCom free rules. Read PDFs **in place**; never copy binaries into git.

Every quote block: **filename + page** (and section when useful).

## Hierarchy

- Full-Scan Core Book = baseline.
- Dated `eng_*` patches (update log, team PDFs, universal equipment) **supersede** on the same topic.
- Jul 25 lite = simplified intro. **Omission is not a patch.**

House line on quote surfaces: Kill Team is Copyright Games Workshop Limited 2024.

`KB/` stays paraphrase. Do not dump `Target_Eligibility.md` quote corpora into KB.

## Print / export

- Print HTML at the table: paraphrase-first event aids + [`gw-unofficial-footer`](gw-unofficial-footer.mdc). Quote cheat sheets stay in-repo; do not treat as public share packs.
- Never redistribute GW downloadable PDFs.
